RisingWave's TPC-H end-to-end tests

The files in this directory are RisingWave's (https://github.com/risingwavelabs/risingwave,
commit d42d130042f0bf2b4ebaa5b6d84f69c66b997744): create_tables.slt.part and the eight
insert_*.slt.part files are e2e_test/tpch/ as they are there, and tpch.test holds the
answers of e2e_test/batch/tpch/q<n>.slt.part for the eleven queries the engine runs,
each query as RisingWave's file holds it but for the rewrites its record names.
They are RisingWave Labs's, under the Apache License, Version 2.0, whose text is
LICENSE beside this file.

The queries and the data's shape are TPC-H's, from the TPC Benchmark H specification
of the Transaction Processing Performance Council (TPC), as RisingWave ships them; no
answer set of the TPC's own kit is vendored here.
